# Xyce: level 57 is BSIMSOI, no pss, fmod and db (63f08969, part k).
# What the fix was for, as the ledger has it: output `.param p={fmod(7,2)+db(10)}`; no report
# entry `function 'fmod' has no spelling in xyce` nor for `db`.
from: spectre
to: xyce
--- input
// t
simulator lang=spectre
parameters p=fmod(7,2)+db(10)
--- output
t
.param p={fmod(7,2)+db(10)}
.end
--- report
